        medium: null,
        hard: null,
      },
      considerations: [
        'Partnerships bid for the right to name trump; the bidding team must meet their contract by combining meld points and trick points. First partnership to reach the agreed target score (e.g. 1500) wins.',
        'Each hand has three phases: auction (players bid; high bidder declares trump), melding (all players show melds; points counted), and trick play (high bidder leads; follow suit; trump wins if unable to follow). Trick points plus meld must meet or exceed the bid or the team is set (bid subtracted).',
        'Double deck (80 cards, no nines)',
        '20 cards each',
      ],
    },
